Dialogue: 10,0:00:00.70,0:00:03.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato Koharu, aku suka padamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.23,0:00:07.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio, aku juga suka...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.96,0:00:10.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.07,0:00:11.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.63,0:00:12.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.85,0:00:21.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.53,0:00:26.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, iya. Semalam aku sedang berendam...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.04,0:00:26.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.47,0:00:37.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,I-Itu bukan mimpi!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.06,0:00:40.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato Koharu, aku suka padamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.37,0:00:42.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.52,0:00:50.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Su-Sulit dipercaya!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.19,0:00:53.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku... Aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.07,0:01:01.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio merasakan hal yang sama denganku!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.65,0:02:37.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wajahmu kusut sekali,\Nseperti dunia sudah kiamat.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.95,0:02:39.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana tidak?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.38,0:02:43.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ditolak oleh cinta pertamaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.03,0:02:51.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, jangan sedih.\NCewek bukan cuma dia seorang.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.98,0:02:53.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cari yang lain!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.38,0:02:59.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi... Tapi aku cuma mau Sato.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.24,0:03:01.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Astaga, kau benar-benar kacau.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya ampun.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.25,0:03:04.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Oshio!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.64,0:03:08.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rinka?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.05,0:03:09.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.19,0:03:10.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh, em...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.11,0:03:13.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih untuk kemarin!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.54,0:03:15.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, jangan sungkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.51,0:03:17.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.71,0:03:19.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.38,0:03:22.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, kau belum pernah bertemu dengannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.06,0:03:24.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini sepupu Sato, Sudo Rinka.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.87,0:03:26.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku Misono Ren.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Salam kenal, Rinka.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.99,0:03:31.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa yang mengizinkanmu\Nmemanggil nama depanku?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.15,0:03:34.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lenganmu tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.21,0:03:36.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, iya. Tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.26,0:03:40.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia baru saja ditolak oleh cinta pertamanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.06,0:03:42.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Badannya sih, tak apa-apa.\NHatinya yang hancur berkeping-keping.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.62,0:03:43.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.21,0:03:44.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.00,0:03:46.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei! Apa yang kau katakan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.18,0:03:47.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ka-Kak Oshio!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.53,0:03:48.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.11,0:03:52.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bo-Boleh aku minta kontakmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.86,0:03:53.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.62,0:03:59.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin berterima kasih\Nlain kali, jadi, anu...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.21,0:04:06.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, tentu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.75,0:04:08.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ka-Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.40,0:04:11.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Sudah.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.74,0:04:12.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.87,0:04:15.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.03,0:04:18.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sampai jumpa lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.75,0:04:19.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sampai jumpa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.69,0:04:22.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.\NGadis yang lebih muda boleh juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.25,0:04:26.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tahan dirimu.\NDia sepupu Sato.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.94,0:04:30.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, kenapa kau menatapku begitu?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.50,0:04:32.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.87,0:04:36.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sa-Sato, mau makan siang bersama?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.19,0:04:38.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.22,0:04:40.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ma-Mau tukar kontak denganku?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.45,0:04:41.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau bilang sesuatu?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.86,0:04:43.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Apa kau mau karaoke sepulang sekolah?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.99,0:04:44.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak mau.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.39,0:04:47.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ujung-ujungnya, tidak ada yang berubah.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.64,0:04:49.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suasana sekolah seperti biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.51,0:04:51.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Istirahat makan siang\Nyang juga seperti biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.64,0:04:54.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Juga Sato si Dingin yang sama seperti biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.95,0:04:55.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau menatapnya terus.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.82,0:04:56.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.66,0:05:00.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini? Kalau tidak kau makan,\Nkuambil, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.94,0:05:03.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memangnya aku bayi?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.07,0:05:04.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Persis.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.35,0:05:08.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kau tidak punya harga diri laki-laki,\Nmenyerah saja mengejarnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.14,0:05:12.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bu-Bukankah ini wajar?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.65,0:05:15.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sampai kemarin,\Ncuma Sato yang ada di pikiranku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.97,0:05:17.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana bisa berubah semudah itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.89,0:05:21.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memaksa diri berubah,\Nitulah laki-laki sejati.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.12,0:05:22.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.66,0:05:25.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengar, biasanya aku tidak peduli
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.77,0:05:28.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,bagaimana orang mengacaukan kisah cintanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.26,0:05:32.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Malah menurutku,\Nlaki-laki sebaiknya gagal sebanyak mungkin.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.03,0:05:34.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena aku bisa dapat kesempatan\Nsaat mereka gagal.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.02,0:05:36.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar-benar jahat...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.51,0:05:40.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitulah aku, dan untuk pertama kalinya,\Naku akan memberimu nasihat
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.32,0:05:43.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,karena kau temanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.28,0:05:45.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lupakan Sato.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.70,0:05:53.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau memang orang baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.26,0:05:54.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.02,0:06:02.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,H-Hei! Sota!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.85,0:06:03.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.38,0:06:08.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio?\NPunya waktu sebentar?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.12,0:06:10.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.54,0:06:12.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.54,0:06:14.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Anu... Ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.49,0:06:17.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,I-Ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.55,0:06:20.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Boleh aku mengunggahnya di Minsta-ku?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.75,0:06:21.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.97,0:06:26.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kau keberatan, tidak apa-apa...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.63,0:06:28.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Aku tidak keberatan! Ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.59,0:06:30.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kau memang mau...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.48,0:06:31.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benarkah?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.47,0:06:32.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.80,0:06:35.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya anak laki-laki tidak suka\Nfotonya diunggah ke Minsta.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.85,0:06:36.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, satu lagi...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.89,0:06:39.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak sabar menunggu\Nke-kencan kita besok.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.70,0:06:43.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanti aku kirim pesan, ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.91,0:06:45.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Sota, apa itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.59,0:06:47.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.89,0:06:50.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak memahami Sato...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.01,0:06:52.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak mengerti!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.91,0:07:02.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak sabar menunggu besok!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.53,0:07:03.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, iya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.75,0:07:05.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus menelepon Oshio.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.23,0:07:07.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.84,0:07:09.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.58,0:07:11.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Koharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.59,0:07:14.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita perlu bicara.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.94,0:07:25.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.99,0:07:26.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.41,0:07:33.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jujur, aku juga tidak tahu\Napa yang dipikirkan Sato,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.47,0:07:35.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi dia mempermainkanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.42,0:07:39.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan bicara begitu tentang dia.\NDia cinta pertamaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.20,0:07:41.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kubilang, berhenti.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.63,0:07:44.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari awal, dia memang bukan levelmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.23,0:07:51.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengar, Sota.\NCinta pertama memang tidak pernah berhasil.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.71,0:07:53.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi hidupmu tidak berakhir di situ.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.79,0:07:56.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang menolak maupun yang ditolak\Ntetap harus menjalani hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.70,0:07:59.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Buat apa kau bertingkah seolah mau mati?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.62,0:08:01.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mati mungkin lebih mudah daripada ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.19,0:08:08.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nonton video porno, tidur delapan jam,\Nbesok pagi kau pasti sudah lupa.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.83,0:08:10.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nih, kukirimi beberapa koleksi favoritku...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.95,0:08:15.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ren, jangan ajari Sota hal-hal begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.35,0:08:17.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayah tidak akan mengizinkannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.35,0:08:21.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah! Dari mana kau muncul, Otot?!\NBaca situasi, dong!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.24,0:08:28.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Panggilan masuk?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.05,0:08:30.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sa-Sato?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.71,0:08:35.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, tapi aku bukan Sato yang kau harapkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.12,0:08:36.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.52,0:08:40.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ayah Koharu, Sato Kazuharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.37,0:08:41.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayah?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.89,0:08:44.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak berhak memanggilku begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.77,0:08:45.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.63,0:08:47.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku langsung saja ke intinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.72,0:08:52.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin membatalkan\Njanji putriku denganmu besok.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.26,0:08:53.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.03,0:08:54.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.34,0:08:56.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tu-Tunggu sebentar!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.20,0:09:00.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa... Pak Kazuharu,\Nkenapa Bapak yang meneleponku soal ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.47,0:09:01.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kazuharu?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.97,0:09:05.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena aku melarang Koharu\Nmenggunakan ponsel.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.24,0:09:05.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.85,0:09:09.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga melarang Koharu keluar rumah.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.26,0:09:10.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hanya itu pertanyaanmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tu-Tunggu sebentar!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.44,0:09:15.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Melarangnya keluar rumah? Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.30,0:09:17.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu bukan urusanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.42,0:09:18.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu urusanku!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.80,0:09:19.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,teman Koharu!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.08,0:09:27.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio Sota, aku tahu tentangmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.27,0:09:30.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya kau akrab dengannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk itu, aku berterima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.97,0:09:35.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi di saat yang sama, ini... Minstagram?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.48,0:09:38.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku cukup kesal karena kau mengajarinya\Nsesuatu yang tidak berguna begini.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.93,0:09:40.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak berguna?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.42,0:09:44.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keadaannya sekarang adalah akibat obsesinya\Npada kegiatan tak berharga itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.22,0:09:45.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia menanggung akibat perbuatannya sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.96,0:09:48.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi tidak perlu sampai menyita ponselnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.93,0:09:50.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong izinkan aku bicara dengan Sato.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.90,0:09:53.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu saja. Sudah dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.04,0:09:53.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.94,0:09:58.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau panggilan ini berakhir,\Nberakhir pula cinta pertamaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.07,0:10:04.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga akan terbebas dari penderitaan ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.45,0:10:06.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi... aku masih...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.04,0:10:09.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu,\NBapak saja yang datang menggantikannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.63,0:10:11.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa maksud...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.82,0:10:14.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau Bapak menolak atas nama Koharu,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.61,0:10:16.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,wajar saja kalau Bapak\Nyang datang menggantikan Koharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.03,0:10:24.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waktu dan tempatnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.29,0:10:29.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Besok di Cafe Tutuji pukul 18.00.\NBisa?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.17,0:10:31.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cafe Tutuji?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.14,0:10:32.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kukirimkan alamatnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.23,0:10:34.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak perlu. Sampai jumpa.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.13,0:10:35.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.75,0:10:44.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tagar apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.43,0:10:49.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sato, kau benar-benar tidak paham\Ncara pakai Minsta...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.78,0:10:57.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayah, aku butuh bantuan
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.67,0:11:01.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,supaya ayah Sato bisa menerima ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.90,0:11:07.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, kau Oshio Sota?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.64,0:11:14.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Silakan, ini Earl Grey.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.09,0:11:15.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.75,0:11:21.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau yang membuatnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.32,0:11:22.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.52,0:11:25.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teh ini juga pernah kusajikan\Nuntuk Koharu sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.06,0:11:26.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.18,0:11:29.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya ada tamu lain hari ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.19,0:11:31.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya sudahlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.68,0:11:35.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertama, aku ingin tahu\Ntujuan pembicaraan ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.21,0:11:39.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio, apa yang kau mau dariku?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.42,0:11:42.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong kembalikan ponsel Koharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.24,0:11:44.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu sesuatu yang sangat penting baginya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.12,0:11:48.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong jangan langsung menolak\Ndan mengekangnya begitu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.29,0:11:50.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm, "mengekang"?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.89,0:11:51.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.06,0:11:55.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kau menganggap ini "mengekang",\Nitu berbeda dengan pemahamanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.43,0:11:59.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Putriku kesulitan mengungkapkan perasaannya
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.52,0:12:02.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan juga kesulitan\Nmembaca perasaan orang lain.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.67,0:12:05.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di sisi lain, dia cenderung menangkap\Nperubahan ekspresi sekecil apa pun
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.53,0:12:07.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu berpikir sangat negatif.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.75,0:12:08.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tahu itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.94,0:12:10.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, aku tahu...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.57,0:12:13.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi menurutku, ini tetap salah!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.46,0:12:15.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang tua normal tidak akan berbuat begini!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.23,0:12:19.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak tahu\Nbagaimana kau mendefinisikan "normal",
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.22,0:12:22.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi sebagai ayah Koharu,\Naku siap ikut campur dalam urusannya
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.70,0:12:26.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan menanggung semua akibatnya\Nkalau terjadi sesuatu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.47,0:12:28.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang, bagaimana denganmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.75,0:12:30.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa maksud Bapak?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.66,0:12:34.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Misalnya, kalau Koharu\Njadi terobsesi pada Minstagram,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.56,0:12:36.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu mengabaikan pelajarannya,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.55,0:12:39.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan gagal masuk universitas\Nyang diinginkannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.46,0:12:44.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Misalnya, kalau foto di suatu unggahan\Nmembuatnya dikucilkan di kelas?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.78,0:12:48.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Si-Siapa pun bisa membuat\Nberbagai pengandaian.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.61,0:12:52.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bertanya, kalau ada sesuatu\Nyang tidak berjalan baik,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.48,0:12:54.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,bagaimana kau akan bertanggung jawab?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.94,0:12:56.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.06,0:13:00.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebagian orang\Nberhenti tumbuh setelah terluka.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.10,0:13:05.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Salahkah aku melindungi putriku\Nagar tidak jadi seperti itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.41,0:13:10.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memang benar katanya,\Nitu salah satu cara melindunginya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.79,0:13:18.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya tidak ada lagi\Nyang ingin kau katakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.55,0:13:20.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski begitu...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.99,0:13:21.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.15,0:13:23.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menurutku, itu salah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.57,0:13:28.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena Koharu sendiri ingin melakukannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.17,0:13:34.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia memilih untuk tumbuh dengan cara itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.34,0:13:39.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Koharu mungkin canggung\Ndan mudah disalahpahami,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.16,0:13:43.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi dia jauh lebih kuat\Ndaripada yang Bapak kira.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.95,0:13:46.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Otot tumbuh dengan cara terluka.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.42,0:13:50.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, saat kehilangan kesempatan\Nuntuk terluka, otot akan menangis.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.19,0:13:53.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.37,0:13:55.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.48,0:14:03.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pokoknya, aku tidak bisa memahami\Nhal yang membuat putriku terobsesi,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.50,0:14:05.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan aku tidak akan pernah bisa diyakinkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.44,0:14:08.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa nilainya\Nmemamerkan foto ke seluruh dunia?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.37,0:14:09.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekadar untuk catatan pribadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.74,0:14:12.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Atau untuk memuaskan\Nkeinginan diakui orang lain?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.21,0:14:16.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenangan dan kesenangan yang didapat\Ndari hal sedangkal itu
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.76,0:14:17.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,pasti sama dangkalnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.03,0:14:23.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu. Kalau begitu,\Naku punya satu permintaan terakhir.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.50,0:14:24.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permintaan?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.59,0:14:26.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong luangkan sedikit lagi waktu Bapak.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.15,0:14:28.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada sesuatu yang ingin
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.74,0:14:29.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,kutunjukkan kepada Bapak.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.27,0:14:34.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.32,0:14:35.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.62,0:14:37.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang, apa lagi yang kau mau?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.86,0:14:41.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebentar lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.73,0:14:57.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.94,0:14:59.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waktu ajaib.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.59,0:15:03.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Momen ajaib sesaat setelah matahari terbenam.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.15,0:15:07.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa Bapak tidak bisa memahaminya?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.88,0:15:09.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pemandangan yang menurutmu indah,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.92,0:15:11.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,hal-hal yang menurutmu lezat,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.23,0:15:12.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,momen yang menurutmu menyenangkan,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.73,0:15:14.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,orang-orang yang bersamamu...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.57,0:15:18.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hal-hal yang tidak ingin kau lupakan,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.12,0:15:20.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,hal-hal yang ingin\Nkau bagikan kepada orang lain...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.40,0:15:22.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu tidak berharga?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.12,0:15:26.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa keinginan untuk berbagi\Nhal yang menyentuh hati dengan orang lain,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.57,0:15:28.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu berteman dengan mereka,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.72,0:15:30.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,merupakan suatu kelemahan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.61,0:15:31.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah itu dangkal?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.57,0:15:35.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar. Aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.88,0:15:40.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bisa mengenal Sato si Dingin...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.14,0:15:44.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,karena Sato berani melangkah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.33,0:15:48.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Inilah dunia di mata Koharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.12,0:15:58.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permintaanku, tolong percayai\Nkekuatan Koharu,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.32,0:16:01.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,keberaniannya untuk mengambil\Nlangkah pertama.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.58,0:16:07.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.\NJadi, inilah yang dilihat Koharu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.54,0:16:09.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah cukup.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.12,0:16:09.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.70,0:16:12.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sengaja meminta mereka\Ndatang ke sini, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.47,0:16:14.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau bahkan melibatkan Rinka.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.42,0:16:18.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Omong-omong, ada satu kesalahpahaman\Nyang harus diluruskan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.17,0:16:19.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.05,0:16:22.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menurutmu, kenapa aku melarang Koharu\Nmemakai ponsel?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.74,0:16:27.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa? Bapak kesal karena Koharu\Nmulai main Minsta.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.30,0:16:27.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.93,0:16:28.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.93,0:16:31.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang tua mana yang tega\Nberbuat begitu di zaman sekarang?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.67,0:16:33.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini alasannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.56,0:16:38.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Paket Ekstra Super Tanpa Batas?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.18,0:16:39.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kuota kami habis.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.90,0:16:42.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jujur saja, anak itu bikin aku pusing.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.74,0:16:43.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.76,0:16:46.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.49,0:16:53.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudnya... Sato terlalu asyik main Minsta
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.09,0:16:56.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,sampai menghabiskan kuota keluarga?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.73,0:17:00.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, bulan ini keluarga kami\Ncuma bisa pakai telepon biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.75,0:17:02.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hmph. Khas Koharu sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.82,0:17:06.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu,\Nkenapa Bapak menyita ponselnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.35,0:17:09.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak mau dia panik\Nlalu mengutak-atik semua pengaturan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.55,0:17:11.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa Bapak melarangnya keluar rumah?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.55,0:17:16.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus mengajaknya ke gerai\Nuntuk mengganti paket data.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.33,0:17:21.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi intinya, ayahnya itu terlalu protektif,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.76,0:17:24.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,canggung, dan tidak pandai menjelaskan,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.68,0:17:27.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,pantas saja Sato mewarisi sifat itu darinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.30,0:17:29.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sisanya, dengar saja langsung dari mulutnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.19,0:17:30.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.20,0:17:39.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sa-Sato?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.76,0:17:40.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.41,0:17:43.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sungguh minta maaf...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.16,0:17:46.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sungguh minta maaf!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.66,0:17:48.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tu-Tunggu, Sato!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.79,0:17:53.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,I-Ini salahku... Aku sudah\Nmerepotkanmu dan semua orang...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.62,0:17:55.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Juga kakigori yang sudah kita janjikan\Nuntuk dimakan bersama.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.82,0:17:58.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sungguh, semuanya... semuanya...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.17,0:17:59.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sungguh minta maaf!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.71,0:18:02.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan! Aku yang langsung\Nmengambil kesimpulan...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.72,0:18:11.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Supaya jelas, yang kupermasalahkan\Ncuma kalau kau terlalu asyik sampai lalai.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.91,0:18:14.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kuharap pengalaman pahit ini\Njadi pelajaran yang bagus untukmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.73,0:18:15.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayah...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.82,0:18:19.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mulai sekarang, kendalikan dirimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.97,0:18:22.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.28,0:18:26.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, tapi bisa tolong\Nantarkan Koharu pulang?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.02,0:18:27.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah? Aku?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.57,0:18:30.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada sedikit urusan yang harus kuselesaikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.15,0:18:31.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.37,0:18:44.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak apa-apa... di belakang?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.55,0:18:46.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Y-Ya. Aku tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.39,0:18:48.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.58,0:18:58.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku benci yang manis-manis,\Nbaik makanan maupun orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.16,0:19:01.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal kau yang paling manis, Kazuharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.47,0:19:07.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kaget juga aku, ternyata\Nteman Sota itu putri teman sekelasku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.27,0:19:08.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah memberitahunya?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.22,0:19:09.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.30,0:19:12.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini bukan informasi yang perlu kubagikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.48,0:19:17.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, benar!\NAyah dan trisep tidak perlu ikut campur!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.24,0:19:19.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia mirip dengan Sakiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.15,0:19:21.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benarkah? Matanya mirip denganku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.76,0:19:24.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak! Maksudku,\Nketekunan dan kegigihannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.94,0:19:29.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, ujung-ujungnya kita cuma mendengar\Nbetapa mereka saling menyukai.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.42,0:19:32.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Konyol. Aku pulang.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.22,0:19:33.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.62,0:19:36.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak usah ditahan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.09,0:19:40.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Malam ini saja aku menangis!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.35,0:19:42.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah, sudah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.94,0:19:44.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Malam ini kita bertiga minum!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.87,0:19:52.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sa...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.11,0:19:54.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.61,0:20:00.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Oshio!\N- Sato!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.10,0:20:01.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.38,0:20:03.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sato, silakan duluan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.81,0:20:06.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ka-Kalau begitu, aku duluan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.16,0:20:07.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anu...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.11,0:20:08.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soal pernyataan cinta beberapa hari lalu...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.23,0:20:13.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ma-Maaf! Kau tidak apa-apa?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.97,0:20:15.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Y-Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.79,0:20:18.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pe-Pernyataan cinta...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.77,0:20:22.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Se-Sebenarnya, aku sedang berendam\Nsaat menerima telepon itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.59,0:20:24.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu aku jadi pusing.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.12,0:20:26.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau berendam terlalu lama?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.01,0:20:28.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bu-Bukan, bukan begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.38,0:20:30.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anu... Jadi...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.69,0:20:31.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.04,0:20:34.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang yang kusukai\Nmenyatakan perasaannya padaku
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.62,0:20:36.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan aku senang sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.23,0:20:47.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi jujur saja, ingatanku agak kabur.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.27,0:20:49.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, aku ingin memberimu\Njawaban sekali lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.05,0:20:51.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jawaban yang sebenarnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.30,0:20:59.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga suka padamu, Oshio.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.91,0:21:03.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sejak lama sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.77,0:21:14.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.54,0:21:15.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan memulai lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.18,0:21:26.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oshio, tadi kau mau bilang apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.29,0:21:31.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cuma, aku ingin terus pergi\Nke berbagai tempat bersamamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.19,0:21:40.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertama, ayo kita makan kakigori.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.99,0:21:44.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, ayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:34.99,0:23:37.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selanjutnya, "Cinta Berbalas Dimulai".
